# Verifier Component Prototype → Usable → Robust
## Phase 0: Prototype (DONE)
- [x] Verifier will be implemented as IPlugin subclass (VerifierPlugin)
- [ ] No verifier plugins implemented yet — this directory will host:
    - VerifierPlugin subclasses (e.g., FuzzingVerifier, ReproduceVerifier)
    - Each must declare: input_types=["vulnerability"], output_types=["verified_vulnerability"]

## Phase 1: Usable
- [x] Implement ReproduceVerifier (calls reproduce.py with PoC)
- [ ] Add basic fuzzing verification stub (e.g., run input → check crash)
- [x] Integrate with Scheduler for async verification tasks

## Phase 2: Robust
- [ ] GDB/QEMU integration for deep debugging
- [ ] Proof-of-concept generation (C/Python PoC from vulnerability evidence)
- [ ] Confidence scoring and false-positive filtering